{
  "mark.5.p1.b1": {
    "text": "On the other side of the sea, they arrived in the region of the Gerasenes.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p1.b2": {
    "text": "As soon as Jesus got out of the boat,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p1.b3": {
    "text": "He was met by a man with an unclean spirit, who was coming from the tombs.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p2.b1": {
    "text": "This man had been living in the tombs",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p2.b2": {
    "text": "And could no longer be restrained, even with chains.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p2.b3": {
    "text": "Though he was often bound with chains and shackles,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p2.b4": {
    "text": "He had broken the chains and shattered the shackles.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p2.b5": {
    "text": "Now there was no one with the strength to subdue him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p2.b6": {
    "text": "Night and day in the tombs and in the mountains he kept crying out",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p2.b7": {
    "text": "And cutting himself with stones.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p3.b1": {
    "text": "When the man saw Jesus from a distance,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p3.b2": {
    "text": "He ran and fell on his knees before Him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p3.b3": {
    "text": "And he shouted in a loud voice,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p3.b4": {
    "text": "What do You want with me, Jesus, Son of the Most High God?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p3.b5": {
    "text": "I beg You before God not to torture me!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p3.b6": {
    "text": "For Jesus had already declared,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p3.b7": {
    "text": "Come out of this man, you unclean spirit!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p4.b1": {
    "text": "What is your name?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p4.b2": {
    "text": "My name is Legion, … for we are many.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p4.b3": {
    "text": "And he begged Jesus repeatedly not to send them out of that region.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p5.b1": {
    "text": "Send us to the pigs, so that we may enter them.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p5.b2": {
    "text": "He gave them permission,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p5.b3": {
    "text": "The herd … rushed down the steep bank into the sea and drowned in the water.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p5.b4": {
    "text": "About two thousand",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p6.b1": {
    "text": "And the people went out to see what had happened.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p6.b2": {
    "text": "When they came to Jesus, they saw the man who had been possessed by the legion of demons",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p6.b3": {
    "text": "Sitting there, clothed and in his right mind;",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p6.b4": {
    "text": "And they were afraid.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p7.b1": {
    "text": "Those who had seen it described what had happened to the demon-possessed man",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p7.b2": {
    "text": "And also to the pigs.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p7.b3": {
    "text": "And the people began to beg Jesus to leave their region.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p8.b1": {
    "text": "The man who had been possessed by the demons begged to go with Him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p8.b2": {
    "text": "Go home to your own people,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p8.b3": {
    "text": "And tell them how much the Lord has done for you, and what mercy He has shown you.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p8.b4": {
    "text": "So the man … began to proclaim throughout the Decapolis how much Jesus had done for him. And everyone was amazed.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p9.b1": {
    "text": "When Jesus had again crossed by boat to the other side,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p9.b2": {
    "text": "A synagogue leader named Jairus arrived, and seeing Jesus,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p9.b3": {
    "text": "My little daughter is near death. Please come and place Your hands on her, so that she will be healed and live.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p9.b4": {
    "text": "So Jesus went with him,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p10.b1": {
    "text": "And a woman was there who had suffered from bleeding for twelve years.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p10.b2": {
    "text": "She had borne much agony under the care of many physicians",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p10.b3": {
    "text": "And had spent all she had,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p10.b4": {
    "text": "But to no avail. Instead, her condition had only grown worse.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p11.b1": {
    "text": "When the woman heard about Jesus, she came up through the crowd behind Him",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p11.b2": {
    "text": "If only I touch His garments, I will be healed.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p11.b3": {
    "text": "Immediately her bleeding stopped,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p11.b4": {
    "text": "And she sensed in her body that she was healed of her affliction.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p12.b1": {
    "text": "At once Jesus was aware that power had gone out from Him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p12.b2": {
    "text": "Who touched My garments?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p12.b3": {
    "text": "You can see the crowd pressing in on You, and yet You ask, ‘Who touched Me?’",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p12.b4": {
    "text": "But He kept looking around to see who had done this.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p13.b1": {
    "text": "Then the woman, knowing what had happened to her, came and fell down before Him trembling in fear,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p13.b2": {
    "text": "And she told Him the whole truth.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p13.b3": {
    "text": "Daughter, … your faith has healed you.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p13.b4": {
    "text": "Go in peace and be free of your affliction.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p14.b1": {
    "text": "Your daughter is dead;",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p14.b2": {
    "text": "Why bother the Teacher anymore?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p14.b3": {
    "text": "Do not be afraid; just believe.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p14.b4": {
    "text": "And He did not allow anyone to accompany Him except Peter, James, and John the brother of James.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p15.b1": {
    "text": "When they arrived at the house of the synagogue leader,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p15.b2": {
    "text": "Why all this commotion and weeping?",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p15.b3": {
    "text": "The child is not dead, but asleep.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p15.b4": {
    "text": "And they laughed at Him.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p16.b1": {
    "text": "After He had put them all outside,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p16.b2": {
    "text": "Talitha koum!",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p16.b3": {
    "text": "Which means, “Little girl, I say to you, get up!”",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p17.b1": {
    "text": "Immediately the girl got up and began to walk around.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p17.b2": {
    "text": "And at once they were utterly astounded.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p17.b3": {
    "text": "She was twelve years old,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:42"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p18.b1": {
    "text": "Then Jesus gave strict orders that no one should know about this,",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.5.p18.b2": {
    "text": "And He told them to give her something to eat.",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "engbsb",
      "ref": "Mark 5:43"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
